 <h3><u>Ali waley jahan baithe</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Faqeeron ka bhi kya chahe jahan basti basa baithe ..(2)<br> ali waley jahan baithe wahi jannat bana baithe ..(2)</p> 
  <p>1. Faraze daar ho, maqtal ho, zindaan ho ke sehra ho ..(2)<br> jali ishq e ali ki shamma aur, parwaane aa baithe</p> 
  <p>2. Koi mausam, koi bhi waqt, koi bhi ilaaqa ho ..(2)<br> jahan zikr e ali chheda, wahan deewane aa baithe</p> 
  <p>3. Ali walon ka marna bhi koi marne me marna hai ..(2)<br> chale apne makaa'n se aur ali ke darr pe jaa baithe</p> 
  <p>4. Idhar rukhsat kiya sabne, udhar aae Ali lene ..(2)<br> yahan sab ro rahe the, hum wahan mehfil sajaa baithe</p> 
  <p>5. Abhi mai qabr me leta hi tha, ek noor sa phailaa ..(2)<br> meri baali pe aakar khud, Ali e murtaza baithe</p> 
  <p>6. Ali ke naam ki mehfil saji shehre khamosha me ..(2)<br> the jitne bawafa wo sab ke sab, mehfil me aa baithe</p> 
  <p>7. Nizamat ke liye maula ne khud, meesam ko bulwaya ..(2)<br> wo lehja tha ke sab daaton tale, ungli dabaa baithe</p> 
  <p>8. Ye kaun aaya ke istaqbaal me, sab ambiya utthe ..(2)<br> na baithega koi tab tak, na jab tak fatema baithe</p> 
  <p>9. Ali walo'n ke marne ka hai bus, itna sa afsana ..(2)<br> ke jaise koi masjid se azakhane me jaa baithe</p> 
  <p>10. Ali walo'n ke naaro ne, raza aisa samaa bandha ..(2)<br> ke khud maula bhi apne naam ka naara laga baithe</p> 
  <p>Ali waley jahan baithe wahi jannat bana baithe</p> 
